  "content": "\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">生物血條模組</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組會在生物上方新增一條血條。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>共有 <strong>13 種可調整位置的血條類型</strong>可供選擇。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">按下「H」鍵即可開啟選單。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其他可調整的選項包含：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>渲染距離</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>縮放</strong>大小</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>名稱顯示</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>生命值顯示</strong>（若所選血條類型支援 HP 顯示）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-設定血條<strong>僅在</strong><strong>生物處於</strong><strong>具有攻擊性、受傷或游標懸停時顯示</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-材質可見度</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-僅顯示受傷的生物</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-在配置檔中<strong>加入生物黑名單</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>-若您使用的是 Forge：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（在&nbsp;<strong>blacklist&nbsp;=&nbsp;minecraft:cow,minecraft:pig&nbsp;</strong>之後輸入，如此即可將這些生物加入黑名單）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>-若您使用的是 Fabric：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（在&nbsp;<strong>blacklist&nbsp;=&nbsp;cow,pig</strong>&nbsp;之後輸入，如此即可將這些生物加入黑名單）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">希望您喜歡這個模組。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若您發現任何問題，請隨時告訴我。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感謝下載此模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=71695030\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sR2IOE0VgXU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
